sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor K as Coordinator
  participant UI as React SPA
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  K->>UI: Dispatch unit to incident #7
  UI->>API: POST /api/dispatches {incident_id, unit_id}
  API->>PG: CALL sp_dispatch_unit(7, unit, user)
  PG->>PG: Check account_type = COORDINATOR (FR-07)
  PG->>PG: Trigger T3: unit AVAILABLE? incident VERIFIED/RESPONDING? (BR-05)
  PG->>PG: INSERT dispatch · unit → DEPLOYED · incident → RESPONDING
  PG->>PG: Trigger T1: timeline entry (logged_by = coordinator)
  alt a rule fails
    PG-->>API: RAISE EXCEPTION / constraint violation
    API-->>UI: 409 with the database's message
  else success
    PG-->>API: OK
    API-->>UI: 201 dispatch row
    UI-->>K: Toast + refreshed incident panel
  end
